# Pairs with ClaimWriteMeetsRoutingClaim (E -> R). E's claim write loses its floor check,
# so the purged incarnation's re-presented claim is admitted over the floor the purge raised.
MODULE: ClaimWriteMeetsRoutingClaimBelowFloor
TARGET: ClaimWriteMeetsRoutingClaim
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: E's claim write admits a claim at or below the floor
PERTURBS: Represent

--- FIND
        /\ EClaimAboveFloor(i, s)
        /\ EClaimAboveEntry(i, s)
--- REPLACE
        /\ EClaimAboveEntry(i, s)
--- END
